{"c":[{"name":"20261007T162304Z-08366a95f58a9161","text":"The Ask card reads a plan's facts blocks only by first-row label: proposal.ts YOU_TYPE_LABEL/LEFT_TO_YOU_LABEL, built in leftToYouBlocks and pinned by golden ask-left.ndjson; a new left-to-you block needs a label there (H1).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T162304Z-c9afd0b1b9d0e995","text":"Under HOLD, typecheck Swift without swift build: swiftc -emit-module CaretScreenCore into /tmp, then CaretHostCore via find (it has subdirs) with -I that dir; tests need the platform Developer Frameworks (-F) and -plugin-path .../host/plugins/testing (H1).","type":"note"}]}
